   228→        // are made available through the `engine_getBlobs` method.  If it exists in the cache, we know
   229→        // it has already passed the gossip checks, even though this particular instance hasn't been
   230→        // seen / published on the gossip network yet (passed the `verify_is_unknown_sidecar` check above).
   231→        // In this case, we should accept it for gossip propagation.
